{"name":"CSS","postlist":[{"title":"Hexo博客优化教程：图库防盗链、回到顶部、悬挂喵功能修复","slug":"Hexo博客优化教程：图库防盗链、回到顶部、悬挂喵功能修复","date":"2026-05-01T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-02T00:28:31.822Z","comments":true,"top":null,"path":"api/articles/Hexo博客优化教程：图库防盗链、回到顶部、悬挂喵功能修复.json","realPath":null,"excerpt":null,"keywords":"医疗互动 02 00 25","cover":null,"content":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-style-marker\" href=\"/assets/css/APlayer.min.css\"><script src=\"/assets/js/APlayer.min.js\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-script-marker\"></script><p>本教程记录了本次对 Hexo 博客的三项修复和优化，包括 Gitee 图库防盗链解决方案、回到顶部按钮冲突修复，以及悬挂喵动画功能的保留。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"一、Gitee-图库防盗链问题\"><a href=\"#一、Gitee-图库防盗链问题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、Gitee 图库防盗链问题\"></a>一、Gitee 图库防盗链问题</h2><h3 id=\"问题现象\"><a href=\"#问题现象\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题现象\"></a>问题现象</h3><p><code>galleries.json</code> 中引用 Gitee 的图片（如 <code>https://gitee.com/huajiaojiang/fuliefu/raw/master/...</code>），在浏览器中打开图库页面时不显示，但直接在浏览器地址栏访问该 URL 却能正常加载。</p>\n<h3 id=\"原因分析\"><a href=\"#原因分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原因分析\"></a>原因分析</h3><p>Gitee 启用了<strong>防盗链（Anti-Hotlink）</strong>机制。当浏览器从你的博客页面加载图片时，会携带 <code>Referer</code> 请求头（值为你的博客域名），Gitee 检测到来源不是 <code>gitee.com</code>，直接返回 <strong>HTTP 403 Forbidden</strong>。</p>\n<p>验证方法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 直接请求（无 Referer）→ 正常返回</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">curl -s -o /dev/null -w <span class=\"string\">&quot;%&#123;http_code&#125;&quot;</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://gitee.com/huajiaojiang/fuliefu/raw/master/image/hexomaterry/babecue.jpg&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 结果：200</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 带 Referer 头（模拟浏览器从博客加载）→ 被拒绝</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">curl -s -o /dev/null -w <span class=\"string\">&quot;%&#123;http_code&#125;&quot;</span> -H <span class=\"string\">&quot;Referer: https://example.com/&quot;</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://gitee.com/huajiaojiang/fuliefu/raw/master/image/hexomaterry/babecue.jpg&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 结果：403</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"解决方案：只对图库图片禁止-Referer\"><a href=\"#解决方案：只对图库图片禁止-Referer\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解决方案：只对图库图片禁止 Referer\"></a>解决方案：只对图库图片禁止 Referer</h3><p><strong>不推荐</strong>全局 <code>&lt;meta name=&quot;referrer&quot; content=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;</code>，因为会影响统计、评论等功能。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐方案</strong>：在图库模板的 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 标签上添加 <code>referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;</code> 属性，<strong>仅对图片生效</strong>。</p>\n<p>修改文件：<code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/gallery.ejs</code>，找到渲染 <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 标签的位置：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">// 修改前</span><br><span class=\"line\">imageStr += &quot;&lt;a href=\\&quot;&quot; + photoUrl + &quot;\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;     class=\\&quot;photo-item\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;example_group\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;     data-fancybox=\\&quot;images\\&quot;&gt;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;      &lt;img src=\\&quot;&quot; + photoUrl + &quot;\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;       alt=\\&quot;&quot; + photo + &quot;\\&quot;&gt;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;    &lt;/a&gt;&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">// 修改后：在 &lt;img&gt; 标签上添加 referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;</span><br><span class=\"line\">imageStr += &quot;&lt;a href=\\&quot;&quot; + photoUrl + &quot;\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;     class=\\&quot;photo-item\\&quot; rel=\\&quot;example_group\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;     data-fancybox=\\&quot;images\\&quot;&gt;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;      &lt;img src=\\&quot;&quot; + photoUrl + &quot;\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;       alt=\\&quot;&quot; + photo + &quot;\\&quot;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;       referrerpolicy=\\&quot;no-referrer\\&quot;&gt;&quot; +</span><br><span class=\"line\">        &quot;    &lt;/a&gt;&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"效果对比\"><a href=\"#效果对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"效果对比\"></a>效果对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>修改前</th>\n<th>修改后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图库页面加载 Gitee 图片</td>\n<td>❌ 403 不显示</td>\n<td>✅ 正常显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>博客其它页面 &#x2F; Gitalk &#x2F; 统计</td>\n<td>✅ 正常</td>\n<td>✅ 正常（不受影响）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"二、galleries-json-语法错误修复\"><a href=\"#二、galleries-json-语法错误修复\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、galleries.json 语法错误修复\"></a>二、galleries.json 语法错误修复</h2><h3 id=\"问题现象-1\"><a href=\"#问题现象-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题现象\"></a>问题现象</h3><p><code>galleries.json</code> 中部分图库完全不显示，Hexo 生成的页面为空。</p>\n<h3 id=\"原因分析-1\"><a href=\"#原因分析-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原因分析\"></a>原因分析</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>URL 域名错误</strong>：使用了不存在的 <code>raw.giteeusercontent.com</code>（混淆了 GitHub 的 <code>raw.githubusercontent.com</code>），应改为 <code>gitee.com</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>JSON 语法错误</strong>：URL 字符串中间被插入了换行符 <code>\\n</code>，导致 JSON 解析失败。</li>\n<li><strong>多余残留代码</strong>：对象已用 <code>&#125;</code> 闭合后，仍有孤立的 <code>&quot;淘宝01.png&quot;</code> 等残留内容。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"修复方法\"><a href=\"#修复方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修复方法\"></a>修复方法</h3><p><strong>修正 URL 域名</strong>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight diff\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">- &quot;https://raw.giteeusercontent.com/huajiaojiang/fuliefu/raw/master/image/hexomaterry/yao.jpg&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"addition\">+ &quot;https://gitee.com/huajiaojiang/fuliefu/raw/master/image/hexomaterry/yao.jpg&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>合并被换行截断的 URL</strong>（JSON 不允许字符串内有裸换行符）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight diff\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">- &quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/.../babecue.jpg</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">- &quot;,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"addition\">+ &quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/.../babecue.jpg&quot;,</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>删除闭合括号后多余的残留代码</strong>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight diff\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">      ]</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">-   &#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">-       &quot;淘宝01.png&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">-     ]</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">-   &#125;,</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"addition\">+   &#125;,</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>验证 JSON 语法：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">python3 -c <span class=\"string\">&quot;import json; json.load(open(&#x27;source/_data/galleries.json&#x27;)); print(&#x27;✓ JSON valid&#x27;)&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三、回到顶部按钮-悬挂喵冲突修复\"><a href=\"#三、回到顶部按钮-悬挂喵冲突修复\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、回到顶部按钮 + 悬挂喵冲突修复\"></a>三、回到顶部按钮 + 悬挂喵冲突修复</h2><h3 id=\"问题现象-2\"><a href=\"#问题现象-2\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题现象\"></a>问题现象</h3><p>博客页面有<strong>两个功能元素</strong>同时存在但互相冲突：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回到顶部按钮</td>\n<td><code>_partial/back-top.ejs</code>（<code>#backTop.top-scroll</code>）</td>\n<td>滚动显示 ↑ 按钮，点击回到顶部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>悬挂的喵</td>\n<td><code>layout.ejs</code> 引入的 <code>szgotop.js</code>（<code>.back-to-top.cd-top</code>）</td>\n<td>页面右侧悬挂一只小猫动画</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>原来的 <code>szgotop.js</code> 绑定的是 <code>.back-to-top</code> 类，同时控制显示&#x2F;隐藏<strong>和</strong>点击跳转。但 <code>.back-to-top</code> 这个类名与 <code>_partial/back-top.ejs</code> 中的回到顶部按钮产生冲突，导致两者都不能正常工作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解决方案\"><a href=\"#解决方案\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"解决方案\"></a>解决方案</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>保留 <code>_partial/back-top.ejs</code></strong> 作为正式的回到顶部按钮（由 <code>matery.js</code> 控制）。</li>\n<li>**去掉外部 <code>szgotop.js</code>**，改为内联脚本，只控制悬挂喵的显示&#x2F;隐藏，且用 <code>.not(&#39;#backTop&#39;)</code> 排除正式按钮。</li>\n<li>悬挂喵的 CSS 仍引用 <code>szgotop.css</code>（提供背景图 <code>scroll.gif</code> 和动画）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>修改文件：<code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">&lt;!-- 悬挂的喵 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">link</span> <span class=\"attr\">rel</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;text/css&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://blog-static.cnblogs.com/files/fsh001/szgotop.css&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;back-to-top cd-top faa-float animated cd-is-visible&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;top: -999px;&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">$(<span class=\"variable language_\">window</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">scroll</span>(<span class=\"keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"params\"></span>) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> ($(<span class=\"variable language_\">window</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">scrollTop</span>() &gt; <span class=\"number\">500</span>) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">        $(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;.back-to-top&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">not</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;#backTop&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">css</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;top&#x27;</span>,<span class=\"string\">&#x27;-200px&#x27;</span>);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    &#125; <span class=\"keyword\">else</span> &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">        $(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;.back-to-top&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">not</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;#backTop&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">css</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;top&#x27;</span>,<span class=\"string\">&#x27;-999px&#x27;</span>);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    &#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">&#125;);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">$(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;.back-to-top&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">not</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;#backTop&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">click</span>(<span class=\"keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"params\"></span>) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    $(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;body,html&#x27;</span>).<span class=\"title function_\">animate</span>(&#123;<span class=\"attr\">scrollTop</span>: <span class=\"number\">0</span>&#125;, <span class=\"number\">600</span>);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">&#125;);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\"></span><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">script</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>关键点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>.not(&#39;#backTop&#39;)</code> 确保只操作悬挂喵的 <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>，不影响 <code>#backTop.top-scroll</code> 按钮。</li>\n<li>滚动超过 500px 显示，低于则隐藏。</li>\n<li>点击喵也可以回到顶部（附加体验）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生效方法\"><a href=\"#生效方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"生效方法\"></a>生效方法</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四、Node-js-DEP0170-警告修复\"><a href=\"#四、Node-js-DEP0170-警告修复\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、Node.js DEP0170 警告修复\"></a>四、Node.js DEP0170 警告修复</h2><h3 id=\"问题现象-3\"><a href=\"#问题现象-3\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题现象\"></a>问题现象</h3><p>Hexo 生成时出现警告：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">(node:2340) [DEP0170] DeprecationWarning: The URL http://localhost:4000，访问图库页面，第112行那张 is invalid.</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"原因分析-2\"><a href=\"#原因分析-2\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原因分析\"></a>原因分析</h3><p>Markdown 文件中，中文逗号 <code>，</code> 紧贴 URL 结尾，Node.js 把 <code>http://localhost:4000，访问图库页面，第112行那张</code> 整体当作一个 URL 来解析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"修复方法-1\"><a href=\"#修复方法-1\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修复方法\"></a>修复方法</h3><p>在 URL 和中文之间加一个空格：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight diff\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"deletion\">- 然后打开 http://localhost:4000，访问图库页面</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"addition\">+ 然后打开 http://localhost:4000 ，访问图库页面</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"修改文件清单\"><a href=\"#修改文件清单\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改文件清单\"></a>修改文件清单</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>修改内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>source/_data/galleries.json</code></td>\n<td>修正 URL 域名、修复换行截断、删除残留代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/gallery.ejs</code></td>\n<td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code> 添加 <code>referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs</code></td>\n<td>用内联脚本替代 <code>szgotop.js</code>，保留悬挂喵，避免冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source/_posts/Gitee 防盗链.md</code></td>\n<td>URL 后加空格修复 DEP0170 警告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","raw":null,"categories":[{"name":"技术教程","path":"api/categories/技术教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Hexo","path":"api/tags/Hexo.json"},{"name":"JavaScript","path":"api/tags/JavaScript.json"},{"name":"Gitee","path":"api/tags/Gitee.json"},{"name":"防盗链","path":"api/tags/防盗链.json"},{"name":"图库","path":"api/tags/图库.json"},{"name":"回到顶部","path":"api/tags/回到顶部.json"},{"name":"CSS","path":"api/tags/CSS.json"}]},{"title":"Hexo悬挂喵修复：全站不显示与超出页面底部的排查与修复","slug":"Hexo悬挂喵修复：全站不显示与超出页面底部的排查与修复","date":"2026-10-18T12:45:00.000Z","updated":"2026-10-18T12:54:32.829Z","comments":true,"top":null,"path":"api/articles/Hexo悬挂喵修复：全站不显示与超出页面底部的排查与修复.json","realPath":null,"excerpt":null,"keywords":"医疗互动 02 00 25","cover":null,"content":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-style-marker\" href=\"/assets/css/APlayer.min.css\"><script src=\"/assets/js/APlayer.min.js\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-script-marker\"></script><p>在《Hexo博客优化教程：图库防盗链、回到顶部、悬挂喵功能修复》里，悬挂喵被改成内联脚本 + <code>#szg-cat</code> 的写法。之后又冒出两个新问题：全站都看不到这只喵，而且它一旦出现就会顶出页面底部。这篇把排查过程和最终修复记下来。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"一、问题现象\"><a href=\"#一、问题现象\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、问题现象\"></a>一、问题现象</h2><ol>\n<li>每个页面右侧都看不到喵，但查看页面源码，<code>&lt;div id=&quot;szg-cat&quot;&gt;</code> 确实在。</li>\n<li>从开发者工具里复制出来的元素长这样（<code>top</code> 是滚动后被 JS 改过的值）：</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;szg-cat&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;cursor: pointer; position: fixed; right: 80px; top: 0px; z-index: 9999; width: 70px; height: 900px; background: url(<span class=\"symbol\">&amp;quot;</span>/medias/images/scroll.gif<span class=\"symbol\">&amp;quot;</span>) no-repeat; transition: all 0.5s ease-in-out 0s; opacity: 1;&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><code>height: 900px</code> 加上 <code>top: 0px</code>，窗口高度不足 900px 时，底部自然就挤出屏幕了。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"二、排查过程\"><a href=\"#二、排查过程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、排查过程\"></a>二、排查过程</h2><h3 id=\"1-先确认元素是从哪来的\"><a href=\"#1-先确认元素是从哪来的\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 先确认元素是从哪来的\"></a>1. 先确认元素是从哪来的</h3><p>全仓库只有一处定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">grep -rn <span class=\"string\">&quot;szg-cat&quot;</span> --include=<span class=\"string\">&quot;*.ejs&quot;</span> --include=<span class=\"string\">&quot;*.html&quot;</span> \\</span><br><span class=\"line\">  --exclude-dir=node_modules --exclude-dir=public .</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs:379</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><code>layout.ejs</code> 是主题外壳，第 19 行就是 <code>&lt;%- body %&gt;</code>，所有页面都从它出。也就是说这不是”某些页面漏了”，而是<strong>所有页面都没有</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-实测元素的实际尺寸\"><a href=\"#2-实测元素的实际尺寸\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 实测元素的实际尺寸\"></a>2. 实测元素的实际尺寸</h3><p>本地起一个静态服务器（绝对路径 <code>/medias/...</code> 在 <code>file://</code> 下会解析到文件系统根目录，所以必须用 http）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cd</span> public &amp;&amp; python3 -m http.server 8123</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>再用无头浏览器取计算样式：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> el = <span class=\"variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;szg-cat&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> cs = <span class=\"title function_\">getComputedStyle</span>(el);</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> r = el.<span class=\"title function_\">getBoundingClientRect</span>();</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">`vh=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;innerHeight&#125;</span> h=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;cs.height&#125;</span> opacity=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;cs.opacity&#125;</span> top=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;r.top&#125;</span> bottom=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;r.bottom&#125;</span>`</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// =&gt; &quot;vh=600 h=0px opacity=0 top=600 bottom=600&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>高度是 0px</strong>。元素在 DOM 里，但没有任何尺寸，而且是透明的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"3-为什么高度会是-0\"><a href=\"#3-为什么高度会是-0\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 为什么高度会是 0\"></a>3. 为什么高度会是 0</h3><p><code>#szg-cat</code> 是个空 div，喵是它的 CSS 背景图。背景图不参与布局计算，空 div 的 <code>height: auto</code> 就是 0；背景永远画不出来。当时那份代码还额外写了 <code>opacity: 0</code>，要滚动超过 300px 才把它设成 1，于是短页面连触发机会都没有。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-那个-900px-是从哪来的\"><a href=\"#4-那个-900px-是从哪来的\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 那个 900px 是从哪来的\"></a>4. 那个 900px 是从哪来的</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">sips -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight public/medias/images/scroll.gif</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># pixelWidth: 70</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># pixelHeight: 900</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>背景图本身就是 70×900。再看它外链的 <code>szgotop.css</code>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight css\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"selector-class\">.back-to-top</span> &#123; <span class=\"comment\">/* ... */</span> <span class=\"attribute\">height</span>: <span class=\"number\">900px</span>; <span class=\"comment\">/* ... */</span> &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">@media</span> (<span class=\"attribute\">max-width</span>:<span class=\"number\">1000px</span>) &#123; <span class=\"selector-class\">.back-to-top</span> &#123; <span class=\"attribute\">display</span>:none <span class=\"meta\">!important</span>; &#125; &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>固定 900px 高，而且窗口宽度小于 1000px 时整个隐藏。对比一下 git 里的版本：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git show HEAD:themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs | grep szg-cat</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># &lt;div id=&quot;szg-cat&quot; style=&quot;cursor:pointer; position:fixed; right:80px; top:-200px;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#  z-index:9999; width:70px; height:900px; background:url(/medias/images/scroll.gif)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#  no-repeat; transition:all .5s ease-in-out; opacity:1;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>HEAD（也就是 CI 构建用的那版）是 <code>top:-200px; height:900px</code>，没有任何视口上限。滚动后 JS 把 <code>top</code> 改成 0，900px 的盒子就直接顶出视口底部。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"三、原因归纳\"><a href=\"#三、原因归纳\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、原因归纳\"></a>三、原因归纳</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全站都不显示</td>\n<td>空 div + <code>height:auto</code> → 计算高度 0px；再叠加 <code>opacity:0</code> + 滚动 300px 才显示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会超出页面底部</td>\n<td>定位和高度写死 900px（沿用 <code>szgotop.css</code> 的值），没有视口上限；小于 1000px 宽时又被 CSS 整个隐藏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个问题互相掩盖：一份代码里是”看得见但越界”，另一份是”不越界但根本看不见”。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"四、修复\"><a href=\"#四、修复\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、修复\"></a>四、修复</h2><p>修改文件：<code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs</code></p>\n<figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">&lt;!-- 悬挂的喵 --&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">link</span> <span class=\"attr\">rel</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;stylesheet&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;text/css&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://blog-static.cnblogs.com/files/fsh001/szgotop.css&quot;</span> /&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;szg-cat&quot;</span> <span class=\"attr\">style</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;cursor:pointer; position:fixed; right:80px; top:0; z-index:9999; width:70px; height:900px; max-height:calc(100vh - 20px); background:url(/medias/images/scroll.gif) no-repeat center top; background-size:contain; transition:all .5s ease-in-out; opacity:1;&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">script</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"language-javascript\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">(<span class=\"keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"params\"></span>)&#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"keyword\">var</span> cat = <span class=\"variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;szg-cat&#x27;</span>);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (!cat) <span class=\"keyword\">return</span>;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"comment\">// 原图 70x900：按视口高度等比缩放，底边不会超出页面底部</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fitCat</span>(<span class=\"params\"></span>) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">        <span class=\"keyword\">var</span> limit = <span class=\"variable language_\">window</span>.<span class=\"property\">innerHeight</span> - <span class=\"number\">20</span>;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">        cat.<span class=\"property\">style</span>.<span class=\"property\">height</span> = <span class=\"title class_\">Math</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">min</span>(<span class=\"number\">900</span>, limit &gt; <span class=\"number\">0</span> ? limit : <span class=\"number\">900</span>) + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;px&#x27;</span>;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    &#125;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"title function_\">fitCat</span>();</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    <span class=\"variable language_\">window</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;resize&#x27;</span>, fitCat);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    cat.<span class=\"title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;click&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"keyword\">function</span>(<span class=\"params\"></span>) &#123;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">        <span class=\"variable language_\">window</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">scrollTo</span>(&#123;<span class=\"attr\">top</span>: <span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"attr\">behavior</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;smooth&#x27;</span>&#125;);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">    &#125;);</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\">&#125;)();</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"language-javascript\"></span><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">script</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>关键点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>height:900px</code> 保留一个基准值，空 div 必须有高度才能画出背景；<code>max-height:calc(100vh - 20px)</code> 让 CSS 层先把底边兜住，即使 JS 没跑也不会越界。</li>\n<li><code>background-size:contain</code> 让整张 70×900 等比缩进盒子，喵画在这张图的底端，所以始终完整可见。</li>\n<li><code>top:0</code> + <code>center top</code> 保持”从页面顶端垂下来”的观感。</li>\n<li>JS 里的 <code>fitCat()</code> 按 <code>window.innerHeight - 20</code> 重算高度并监听 <code>resize</code>，双保险。</li>\n<li>去掉”滚动 300px 才显示”，<code>opacity:1</code> 直接可见；点击仍然回到顶部。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"五、验证\"><a href=\"#五、验证\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"五、验证\"></a>五、验证</h2><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">npx hexo generate</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># INFO  216 files generated in 781 ms</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>600px 视口下重新实测同一个元素：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">vh=600 h=580px w=70px opacity=1 bgSize=contain top=0 bottom=580 越界=NO</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证项</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>站点生成</td>\n<td>216 个文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带新版标记的页面</td>\n<td>212 &#x2F; 220</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>600px 视口实测</td>\n<td>高 580px，底边 580，不越界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首页 &#x2F; 归档 &#x2F; 分类 &#x2F; 文章页抽检</td>\n<td>均含新版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"六、这些页面仍然不会有喵\"><a href=\"#六、这些页面仍然不会有喵\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"六、这些页面仍然不会有喵\"></a>六、这些页面仍然不会有喵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>页面</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>box/index.html</code>、<code>box/404.html</code>、<code>box/cn/about.html</code>、<code>box/en/about.html</code></td>\n<td>拷贝进来的第三方项目，是 <code>source/</code> 里的独立 HTML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>live2d-w/demo/demo.html</code>、<code>live2d-w/demo/login.html</code></td>\n<td>看板娘 demo 页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>search/lyb.html</code></td>\n<td>front-matter 里写了 <code>layout: &quot;false&quot;</code>，故意不走主题布局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>jichou/index.html</code></td>\n<td>记仇表情包生成器，独立 HTML</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些页面不经过主题的 <code>layout.ejs</code>，所以拿不到这个浮层。要在这些页面上也挂喵，得把同一段 <code>div + script</code> 直接写进对应文件里。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"七、上线注意\"><a href=\"#七、上线注意\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"七、上线注意\"></a>七、上线注意</h2><ol>\n<li>改的是主题源码，必须重新生成并部署才会生效（<code>hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo d</code>，或等 CI 构建）；CI 构建的是仓库里的提交内容，别忘了 <code>git push</code>。</li>\n<li>仓库根目录还留着一份更早的构建产物（<code>index.html</code>、<code>archives/</code> 等），用的是旧的 <code>.back-to-top</code> 类写法；而 <code>.github/workflows/deploy.yml</code> 是把<strong>仓库根目录整包</strong>当站点上传的。如果那份 Pages 也在提供访问，它不会跟着更新，建议把上传路径改成 <code>public</code>。</li>\n<li><code>szgotop.css</code> 现在已无实际用途（新构建里 <code>back-to-top</code> &#x2F; <code>cd-top</code> 出现 0 次），可以删掉那个外链，少一个外部依赖。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"附：本地复现与验证步骤\"><a href=\"#附：本地复现与验证步骤\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"附：本地复现与验证步骤\"></a>附：本地复现与验证步骤</h2><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 1. 起静态服务器（必须在 public 目录下，用 http 而不是 file://）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">cd</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;博客目录/public&quot;</span> &amp;&amp; python3 -m http.server 8123</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 2. 浏览器打开 http://127.0.0.1:8123/index.html</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">#    在控制台执行，看元素到底有没有尺寸</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> el = <span class=\"variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;szg-cat&#x27;</span>);</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> cs = <span class=\"title function_\">getComputedStyle</span>(el);</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">const</span> r = el.<span class=\"title function_\">getBoundingClientRect</span>();</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"title function_\">log</span>(<span class=\"string\">`vh=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;innerHeight&#125;</span> h=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;cs.height&#125;</span> opacity=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;cs.opacity&#125;</span> top=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;r.top&#125;</span> bottom=<span class=\"subst\">$&#123;r.bottom&#125;</span>`</span>);</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>只要 <code>h</code> 不是 0、<code>opacity</code> 是 1、<code>bottom</code> 不超过 <code>innerHeight</code>，就说明喵既显示出来了，也没有跑出页面底部。</p>\n","raw":null,"categories":[{"name":"技术教程","path":"api/categories/技术教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Hexo","path":"api/tags/Hexo.json"},{"name":"JavaScript","path":"api/tags/JavaScript.json"},{"name":"CSS","path":"api/tags/CSS.json"},{"name":"悬挂喵","path":"api/tags/悬挂喵.json"},{"name":"前端调试","path":"api/tags/前端调试.json"}]},{"title":"大红灯笼左右对称布局教程","slug":"大红灯笼左右对称布局教程","date":"2026-05-01T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-02T06:18:19.235Z","comments":true,"top":null,"path":"api/articles/大红灯笼左右对称布局教程.json","realPath":null,"excerpt":null,"keywords":"医疗互动 02 00 25","cover":null,"content":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-style-marker\" href=\"/assets/css/APlayer.min.css\"><script src=\"/assets/js/APlayer.min.js\" class=\"aplayer-secondary-script-marker\"></script><p>本教程记录了如何将 Hexo 博客的春节主题大红灯笼从右侧单边布局改为左右对称布局。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\"><a href=\"#问题背景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"问题背景\"></a>问题背景</h2><p>原来的春节主题中，两个大红灯笼都固定在页面<strong>右侧</strong>（<code>right: -20px</code> 和 <code>right: 10px</code>），视觉上不够对称。</p>\n<p>布局结构（<code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/layout/layout.ejs</code> 第244-264行）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight html\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">&lt;!--大红灯笼--&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;denglong&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;deng-box&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\">&lt;!-- 第一个灯笼：&quot;过节&quot; --&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">div</span> <span class=\"attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"string\">&quot;deng-box1&quot;</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\">&lt;!-- 第二个灯笼：&quot;福到&quot; --&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"name\">div</span>&gt;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<ul>\n<li><code>.deng-box</code>：第一个灯笼</li>\n<li><code>.deng-box1</code>：第二个灯笼</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"修改方案\"><a href=\"#修改方案\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改方案\"></a>修改方案</h2><p>修改文件：<code>themes/hexo-theme-matery/source/css/matery.css</code>（第1486行）</p>\n<h3 id=\"修改前\"><a href=\"#修改前\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改前\"></a>修改前</h3><figure class=\"highlight css\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"selector-class\">.deng-box</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">position</span>: fixed;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">top</span>: -<span class=\"number\">40px</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">right</span>: -<span class=\"number\">20px</span>;    <span class=\"comment\">/* 右侧 */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"number\">999</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"selector-class\">.deng-box1</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">position</span>: fixed;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">top</span>: -<span class=\"number\">30px</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">right</span>: <span class=\"number\">10px</span>;     <span class=\"comment\">/* 右侧 */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"number\">999</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"修改后\"><a href=\"#修改后\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"修改后\"></a>修改后</h3><figure class=\"highlight css\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"selector-class\">.deng-box</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">position</span>: fixed;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">top</span>: -<span class=\"number\">40px</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">right</span>: -<span class=\"number\">20px</span>;    <span class=\"comment\">/* 右侧（不变） */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"number\">999</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"selector-class\">.deng-box1</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">position</span>: fixed;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">top</span>: -<span class=\"number\">30px</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">left</span>: <span class=\"number\">10px</span>;      <span class=\"comment\">/* ← 改为左侧 */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"attribute\">z-index</span>: <span class=\"number\">999</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>核心改动：<strong>只改了一行</strong>，将 <code>.deng-box1</code> 的 <code>right: 10px</code> 改为 <code>left: 10px</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"效果对比\"><a href=\"#效果对比\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"效果对比\"></a>效果对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>修改前</th>\n<th>修改后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.deng-box</code>（”过节”灯笼）</td>\n<td>右侧 <code>right: -20px</code></td>\n<td>右侧 <code>right: -20px</code>（不变）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deng-box1</code>（”福到”灯笼）</td>\n<td>右侧 <code>right: 10px</code></td>\n<td><strong>左侧</strong> <code>left: 10px</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>修改后效果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ 页面左上角悬挂一个灯笼（”福到”）</li>\n<li>✅ 页面右上角悬挂一个灯笼（”过节”）</li>\n<li>✅ 左右对称，视觉更协调</li>\n<li>✅ 移动端和桌面端都生效（灯笼仅在春节主题模式 <code>themespring</code> 下显示）</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关-CSS-说明\"><a href=\"#相关-CSS-说明\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关 CSS 说明\"></a>相关 CSS 说明</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类名</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>.denglong</code></td>\n<td>灯笼容器，<code>display: none</code> 默认隐藏，<code>body.themespring .denglong &#123; display: block &#125;</code> 激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deng-box</code> &#x2F; <code>.deng-box1</code></td>\n<td>两个灯笼的定位容器，<code>position: fixed</code> 固定在视窗上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deng</code></td>\n<td>灯笼主体，圆角红色 + 摇摆动画 <code>swing</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deng-a</code> &#x2F; <code>.deng-b</code></td>\n<td>灯笼内部装饰线条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.deng-t</code></td>\n<td>灯笼上的文字（”过节”、”福到”）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>.xian</code></td>\n<td>灯笼上方的悬挂线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"生效方法\"><a href=\"#生效方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"生效方法\"></a>生效方法</h2><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">hexo clean &amp;&amp; hexo g &amp;&amp; hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>开启春节主题模式后（点击页面上的节日图标），即可看到左右对称的大红灯笼。</p>\n","raw":null,"categories":[{"name":"技术教程","path":"api/categories/技术教程.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Hexo","path":"api/tags/Hexo.json"},{"name":"CSS","path":"api/tags/CSS.json"},{"name":"灯笼","path":"api/tags/灯笼.json"},{"name":"春节主题","path":"api/tags/春节主题.json"},{"name":"布局","path":"api/tags/布局.json"}]}]}